{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/166","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/166/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/166/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/166/events","html_url":"https://github.com/vimeo/psalm/issues/166","id":232728297,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUyMzI3MjgyOTc=","number":166,"title":"Psalm doesn't process require_once once","user":{"login":"jdwx","id":2722779,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MjI3Nzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2722779?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwx","html_url":"https://github.com/jdwx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdwx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":486061586,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0ODYwNjE1ODY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ee0701","default":true,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2017-05-31T23:45:10Z","updated_at":"2017-06-06T14:12:03Z","closed_at":"2017-06-06T14:12:03Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Given two files, One.php:\r\n\r\n```\r\nrequire_once __DIR__ . '/Two.php';\r\n```\r\n\r\nand Two.php:\r\n\r\n```\r\nrequire_once __DIR__ . '/One.php';\r\n```\r\n\r\nPsalm bounces between the two files in an infinite loop and eventually dies:\r\n\r\n```\r\n$ psalm One.php\r\n\r\nFatal error: Allowed memory size of 2147483648 bytes exhausted (tried to allocate 20480 bytes) in /data/phplib/vendor/vimeo/psalm/src/Psalm/Provider/CacheProvider.php on line 53\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe same issue occurs if require_once is changed to include_once.\r\n\r\nIt seems like it's the ```__DIR__``` special variable that's throwing it off.  Changing these to './One.php' or even './' . 'One.php' allows psalm to run without issue.  (But the . has a different meaning than ```__DIR__```.)\r\n\r\nThanks!\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"muglug","id":2292638,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyOTI2Mzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2292638?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug","html_url":"https://github.com/muglug","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/166/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issue